OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque to be unveiled for
OL,4,APaddington author
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blue plaque is set to be unveiled at
OL,7,Fthe Surrey home once lived in by
OL,8,FPaddington Bear creator Michael Bond.
OL,10,FBond, who died in 2017 at the age of
OL,11,F91, moved to Fairacre in Haslemere in
OL,12,F1968, where he spent the next 10 years
OL,13,Fwriting several Paddington books
OL,14,Falongside the scripts for the original
OL,15,Ftelevision series.
OL,17,FSaturday's unveiling will take place
OL,18,Fwith the permission of current owners,
OL,19,FSteph and Neil Stephenson, who learned
OL,20,Fof their home's fame after the
OL,21,FHaslemere Society "dropped a letter
OL,22,Fthrough our doorbox".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
