OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque to be unveiled for
OL,4,APaddington author
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was exciting. We had suspected that
OL,7,Fhe'd lived here, but really had no idea
OL,8,Fwhat that meant, or how long he'd even
OL,9,Flived here for," Steph told BBC Radio
OL,10,FSurrey.
